{"title":"Thak Reaver","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 62 Thak that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver?lv=62\">Lv 62</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver?lv=65\">Lv 65 <span>68</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver?lv=66\">Lv 66 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver?lv=62\" title=\"Pick level 62\"><td><b>62</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>65</b></td><td>490</td><td>40.3</td><td>3,250</td><td class=\"muted\">1,470 · 56.4 · 9,750</td><td>68</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver?lv=66\" title=\"Pick level 66\"><td><b>66</b></td><td>497</td><td>40.8</td><td>3,300</td><td class=\"muted\">1,491 · 57.1 · 9,900</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 12 recorded drops, 1,103 total, 35–134 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×35–134</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"trout-pie\" title=\"Trout Pie - in 4 of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 4 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/cc91c9ea50a30869c73e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Trout Pie</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-head\" title=\"Thorn Head - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/dd84a2400daf93f8aefd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Thak Fortress</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 71</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6703\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Thak: <a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman\">Thak Spearman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-shieldbearer\">Thak Shieldbearer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(56)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-gatewarden\">Thak Gatewarden</a> <span class=\"muted\">(65)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-forgemaster\">Thak Forgemaster</a> <span class=\"muted\">(66)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-war-captain\">Thak War-Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(67)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran\">Thak Veteran</a> <span class=\"muted\">(68)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-warlord-boss\">Thak Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(70)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-warlord\">Thak Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(75)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/a0170e59ed8f65bfd7f3.webp\" alt=\"Thak Reaver\"></div><h3>Thak Reaver</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>65</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 62)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Thak</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>490</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>40.3</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,250</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)<